  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jordan Public Procurement Reform Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the IDF grant is to support the Jordanian efforts to implement top priority procurement reform actions. The proposed grant will focus on the following main areas that would follow the approval of the new public procurement By-law and would create the basis for its effective implementation:  - Support the establishment of the Public Procurement Regulatory Unit and related institutional arrangements;  - Support to create an independent complaint review mechanism as foreseen in the By-Law; - Revision of the national standard bidding documents and manual of procedures to be in line with the procurement By-law. - Formulation of a national procurement training strategy based on comprehensive training needs assessment - Preparation for e-Procurement / e-tendering</narrative>
  </description>
